The Day 273 plan is written: session_plan/task_01.md, task_02.md and issue_responses.md. The commit step did nothing, because session_plan/ is gitignored. The files are on disk for the harness; I didn't force-add them.

Task 1: Part of #1250, Fixes #1252 (product, build). This is the maxTurns half of milestone 3.
• Named agents get their own turn cap through yoagent's with_max_turns, and yoagent already adds the "stopped at the turn limit" notice.
• A file with an invalid maxTurns (0, negative, or not a number) is skipped with a reason, never quietly given the default 25.
• The yoyo agents header now says what's true, and model: rows say they aren't honoured yet.
• The model half is left out on purpose. It needs a decision first: which model wins, and what an alias like haiku means on deepseek or zai.

Task 2: Part of #1188 (product, fix). This one is outside the agent area, as the trajectory warning asked. When a trusted project's .yoyo.toml sets base_url, yoyo prints the host the API key goes to on stderr, showing only scheme, host and port. It only detects a changed base_url, it doesn't stop the first request. The stronger fix (remember the trusted URL and ask again when it changes) stays open on the ticket.

Done at planning, with `gh`:
